    {
      "number": 28,
      "category": "",
      "title": "梁書卷二十八·裴之橫與子鳳寶",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "臺城。及陸納據湘州叛，又隸王僧辯南討焉。于陣斬納將李賢明，遂平之。又破武陵王於硤口。還除吳興太守，乃作百幅被，以成其初志。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002"
      ],
